(6968963, 1052231, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here. A couple of things to think about for the next one... I think the tub is too small to hold the child. His face is all scrunched because it is being held tight to his body by the edge of the tub. The shot seems a little top heavy and out of balance, because the composiiton is an inverted triangle shape. Perhaps shooting from a slightly higher angle would help these two issues. I also think the processing is a little dark and grungy for a baby shot. Perhaps changing out the background and the textured blanket to something softer, as well as using lighter clothing on the baby.</td>', 'I like the concept here. A couple of things to think about for the next one... I think the tub is too small to hold the child. His face is all scrunched because it is being held tight to his body by the edge of the tub. The shot seems a little top heavy and out of balance, because the composiiton is an inverted triangle shape. Perhaps shooting from a slightly higher angle would help these two issues. I also think the processing is a little dark and grungy for a baby shot. Perhaps changing out the background and the textured blanket to something softer, as well as using lighter clothing on the baby.', '2013-02-01 11:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6968968, 1052175, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I think the lines of the edges of her nose needs a little shadow to define those edges. It looks a little bulbous as it is. I am no expert, but maybe a little touch of the burn brush to create that edge?? Otherwise, a great portrait.</td>', 'Lovely. I think the lines of the edges of her nose needs a little shadow to define those edges. It looks a little bulbous as it is. I am no expert, but maybe a little touch of the burn brush to create that edge?? Otherwise, a great portrait.', '2013-02-01 11:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6968970, 1052008, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, definitely needs a pop of color on the trail to add interest.</td>', 'Nice scene, definitely needs a pop of color on the trail to add interest.', '2013-02-01 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6968973, 1051597, 113156, '<td valign="top">Exquisite in her solitude, fabulous and haunting work, could possibly be a Paul shot.</td>', 'Exquisite in her solitude, fabulous and haunting work, could possibly be a Paul shot.', '2013-02-01 11:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
