(6969224, 1052203, 108069, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful area, and well captured here. I like the layers of foliage leading up to the peaks.</td>', 'Such a beautiful area, and well captured here. I like the layers of foliage leading up to the peaks.', '2013-02-01 14:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969231, 1048949, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I have taken many shots like this and have always gotten caught up in the color of the water, etc., and it''s refreshing to see this done differently, using the beautiful back-lighting of the sun for a colorless silhouette, playing up the contrast in the water throughout. Nice one.</td>', 'Nicely done. I have taken many shots like this and have always gotten caught up in the color of the water, etc., and it''s refreshing to see this done differently, using the beautiful back-lighting of the sun for a colorless silhouette, playing up the contrast in the water throughout. Nice one.', '2013-02-01 14:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969236, 1050872, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Portal indeed, into the different stories, all possibly subplots of the formal occasion that may have brought them all together, if they even are. Excellently framed to present it so effectively. Great tones.<br/> <br/>Truly wonderful.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Portal indeed, into the different stories, all possibly subplots of the formal occasion that may have brought them all together, if they even are. Excellently framed to present it so effectively. Great tones. Truly wonderful.', '2013-02-01 14:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
