(6969416, 1049748, 114225, '<td valign="top">Just a slight movement to the left... :)  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1049612" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1690/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1049612.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1690/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1049612.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1690/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1049612.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/> <br/>I like the swirl of clouds a bit more in this one.<br/> <br/>I have noticed something. If I take my hand and block out much of the left side of the image (so the the tall pine starts to create a natural border), the image seems to pop a little more. Try that crop, and let me know if you like it too.</td>', 'Just a slight movement to the left... :)     I like the swirl of clouds a bit more in this one. I have noticed something. If I take my hand and block out much of the left side of the image (so the the tall pine starts to create a natural border), the image seems to pop a little more. Try that crop, and let me know if you like it too.', '2013-02-01 17:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
