(6969703, 1050679, 157380, '<td valign="top">unconditional love</td>', 'unconditional love', '2013-02-02 07:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969706, 1052193, 67258, '<td valign="top">Intrigued as to whether this is a ''super-macro'' or a photo of an ornament of some sort.  This is one of those rare occasions when knowing the difference would actually affect my score, but all I can do is comment on the image as presented.  The shades of grey, with the almost metalic sheen are rather lovely and it is an image that has made me stop and look.  I find the ''blackground'' a little dominating, and wish it was somehow softer.  Looking forward to reading your photographer notes.</td>', 'Intrigued as to whether this is a ''super-macro'' or a photo of an ornament of some sort.  This is one of those rare occasions when knowing the difference would actually affect my score, but all I can do is comment on the image as presented.  The shades of grey, with the almost metalic sheen are rather lovely and it is an image that has made me stop and look.  I find the ''blackground'' a little dominating, and wish it was somehow softer.  Looking forward to reading your photographer notes.', '2013-02-02 07:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969708, 1051597, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gosh, this was a surprise!  I really like it - aesthetically pleasing, intriguing, challenging, everything I want in my art.</td>', 'Gosh, this was a surprise!  I really like it - aesthetically pleasing, intriguing, challenging, everything I want in my art.', '2013-02-02 07:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969710, 1052220, 67258, '<td valign="top">The pose is hilarious and I rather like the processing and clutter; it seems very much that this is the cat''s home, domain - any humans who live here are, I suspect, very much incidental to the household!  A real shame that the depth of field isn''t wide enough to allow the cat''s nose to be in focus.</td>', 'The pose is hilarious and I rather like the processing and clutter; it seems very much that this is the cat''s home, domain - any humans who live here are, I suspect, very much incidental to the household!  A real shame that the depth of field isn''t wide enough to allow the cat''s nose to be in focus.', '2013-02-02 07:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969711, 1052114, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not to my taste, stylistically, so voting based on technicals.  I''m not sure that the backdrop really works as well as you might have hoped - the way it hangs make it very clear that it is fabric, and this takes away from the ''underwater'' feeling that I think you were after.</td>', 'Not to my taste, stylistically, so voting based on technicals.  I''m not sure that the backdrop really works as well as you might have hoped - the way it hangs make it very clear that it is fabric, and this takes away from the ''underwater'' feeling that I think you were after.', '2013-02-02 08:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969713, 1052101, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super lighting and styling of the model.  I do find the stark white of the hands a little at odds with the rest of her skin colouring.</td>', 'Super lighting and styling of the model.  I do find the stark white of the hands a little at odds with the rest of her skin colouring.', '2013-02-02 08:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969714, 1050739, 67258, '<td valign="top">I suspect that this was amazing to view in person, but I''m not sure it translates so well to a photograph.  I find it difficult to settle my eyes, and finding myself hunting for a place to focus on.  It may, of course, look much better at a larger size.</td>', 'I suspect that this was amazing to view in person, but I''m not sure it translates so well to a photograph.  I find it difficult to settle my eyes, and finding myself hunting for a place to focus on.  It may, of course, look much better at a larger size.', '2013-02-02 08:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
