(6969743, 1052161, 65234, '<td valign="top">There is motion in the clouds that pulls my eye right in to this scene.  Very much like the light, too.  My favorite watery landscape in this challenge.</td>', 'There is motion in the clouds that pulls my eye right in to this scene.  Very much like the light, too.  My favorite watery landscape in this challenge.', '2013-02-02 08:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
