(6969748, 1051889, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love that bokeh!  A really fun image, and quite different from most bug shots I''ve ever seen or taken.  Nit:  the fly''s reflection looks a tad sharper than the fly itself; I might have hand-sharpened the fly a bit more to see if I could get that extra bit of sharpness, at least on the eye.  Or re-shot with a little more DOF (like a fly is going to stay perfectly posed LOL).</td>', 'Love that bokeh!  A really fun image, and quite different from most bug shots I''ve ever seen or taken.  Nit:  the fly''s reflection looks a tad sharper than the fly itself; I might have hand-sharpened the fly a bit more to see if I could get that extra bit of sharpness, at least on the eye.  Or re-shot with a little more DOF (like a fly is going to stay perfectly posed LOL).', '2013-02-02 08:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
