(6971546, 1051938, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice attempt, there''s too much blur for me, I want something to be sharp either panned with the boarder and trees blurred or focused on the trees with the blurred boarder.  The centered boarder and subdues colors don''t help with the dynamic feeling that the image could have.</td>', 'nice attempt, there''s too much blur for me, I want something to be sharp either panned with the boarder and trees blurred or focused on the trees with the blurred boarder.  The centered boarder and subdues colors don''t help with the dynamic feeling that the image could have.', '2013-02-04 12:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
