(6972847, 1052049, 62318, '<td valign="top">One of the better landscapes in this challenge. Would have been and 8-10 perhaps if it were cropped to 8x10 or 1x1 to get rid of the bright light on the left. I think it is the only area that takes away from the otherwise marvelous shot. Really enjoy the composition of the peak on the right. It''s good (at a 7). Good luck to you.</td>', 'One of the better landscapes in this challenge. Would have been and 8-10 perhaps if it were cropped to 8x10 or 1x1 to get rid of the bright light on the left. I think it is the only area that takes away from the otherwise marvelous shot. Really enjoy the composition of the peak on the right. It''s good (at a 7). Good luck to you.', '2013-02-05 23:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972848, 1050077, 62318, '<td valign="top">My favorite landscape/candid of the group. Great sense of scale and so much interest. It''s one of those pieces that speaks to humanity and I am tickled by it.</td>', 'My favorite landscape/candid of the group. Great sense of scale and so much interest. It''s one of those pieces that speaks to humanity and I am tickled by it.', '2013-02-05 23:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
