(6972850, 1051826, 62318, '<td valign="top">A very convincing light shot. 2nd place in regards to candids in this group. Good lighting and gestures of the subjects. Not sure on the title? Solid 8.</td>', 'A very convincing light shot. 2nd place in regards to candids in this group. Good lighting and gestures of the subjects. Not sure on the title? Solid 8.', '2013-02-05 23:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972852, 1051580, 62318, '<td valign="top">The best portrait in this set. Beautiful tones. Good mix of textures. Necklace and belt give the subject some good definition (as well as the brilliant slight of leg). The way the umbrella''s poles doesn''t intrude on the background... it shows you have mad skills. It''s a 9. 10 if the expression is were slightly different (I bet some of the outtakes had better facial expressions, but likely missed on the other key components... just a guess). Good luck to you.</td>', 'The best portrait in this set. Beautiful tones. Good mix of textures. Necklace and belt give the subject some good definition (as well as the brilliant slight of leg). The way the umbrella''s poles doesn''t intrude on the background... it shows you have mad skills. It''s a 9. 10 if the expression is were slightly different (I bet some of the outtakes had better facial expressions, but likely missed on the other key components... just a guess). Good luck to you.', '2013-02-05 23:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972888, 1051723, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love landscapes that manage to use the whole frame with thoughtful light. This is it. Good job. 8.</td>', 'Wow! I love landscapes that manage to use the whole frame with thoughtful light. This is it. Good job. 8.', '2013-02-05 23:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972890, 1051916, 62318, '<td valign="top">This is one great abstract, my favorite in the challenge in that field. Wonderful variation in textures and the two tone palette works will here. So many nice lines. I hope it does well for you as it is a very engaging piece.</td>', 'This is one great abstract, my favorite in the challenge in that field. Wonderful variation in textures and the two tone palette works will here. So many nice lines. I hope it does well for you as it is a very engaging piece.', '2013-02-05 23:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
