(6973612, 1050872, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1, tied with another.<br/>Normally these "take a photo of myself in the mirror/window" are trite. What definitely separates this from the chafe are the characters in the two outer panes. Those kick so much ass that this shot rose to one of my two favorites of the free study.<br/> <br/>Should add your pose adds to the awesome feeling. It has so much of laissez-faire attitude that I love it.<br/> <br/>Edited for spelling and added quotations.</td>', '#1, tied with another.Normally these "take a photo of myself in the mirror/window" are trite. What definitely separates this from the chafe are the characters in the two outer panes. Those kick so much ass that this shot rose to one of my two favorites of the free study. Should add your pose adds to the awesome feeling. It has so much of laissez-faire attitude that I love it. Edited for spelling and added quotations.', '2013-02-06 16:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973671, 1051584, 136989, '<td valign="top">I love this shot but the sun is very overpowering.  It detracts quite a bit from the scene.  Maybe a little more behind one of the limbs would have balanced it.</td>', 'I love this shot but the sun is very overpowering.  It detracts quite a bit from the scene.  Maybe a little more behind one of the limbs would have balanced it.', '2013-02-06 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973690, 1050224, 136989, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Great leading lines to the citadel and a wonderfully intense sky. My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Great leading lines to the citadel and a wonderfully intense sky. My favorite in this challenge.', '2013-02-06 18:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973694, 1051854, 136989, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  I love the character you''ve captured in his face.  Between the snow clumps and that grin he''s almost a human.  Great capture.</td>', 'Adorable!  I love the character you''ve captured in his face.  Between the snow clumps and that grin he''s almost a human.  Great capture.', '2013-02-06 18:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973695, 1051826, 136989, '<td valign="top">Terrific effect.  Love the leading line of the road and how the light pushes you back to the couple.</td>', 'Terrific effect.  Love the leading line of the road and how the light pushes you back to the couple.', '2013-02-06 18:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973701, 1050564, 136989, '<td valign="top">A tender moment captured in time.  If I was the young lady in the picture I would love to hang it on my wall. Great details and use of the shadows/highlights.</td>', 'A tender moment captured in time.  If I was the young lady in the picture I would love to hang it on my wall. Great details and use of the shadows/highlights.', '2013-02-06 18:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973706, 1052215, 136989, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of this type of border but yours is at least of an appropriate size relative to the picture.  The light line was a nice touch too.  The real focus for me is that awesome reflection though. Stark, yet beautiful.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of this type of border but yours is at least of an appropriate size relative to the picture.  The light line was a nice touch too.  The real focus for me is that awesome reflection though. Stark, yet beautiful.', '2013-02-06 18:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973709, 1051580, 136989, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and use of space.  The balance of the very detailed brick wall with the woman gazing off into the distance is perfect.</td>', 'I love the tones and use of space.  The balance of the very detailed brick wall with the woman gazing off into the distance is perfect.', '2013-02-06 18:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973713, 1050679, 136989, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot.  I love that they are holding hands and how eager the puppy is to have her attention. Nice balance of color to offset her darker clothes.</td>', 'Terrific shot.  I love that they are holding hands and how eager the puppy is to have her attention. Nice balance of color to offset her darker clothes.', '2013-02-06 18:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973720, 1052155, 136989, '<td valign="top">I like how the trail fades off in the distance and draws my eye to the light fog in the trees.  I like the b/w but I do wonder what the color one looks like given the snow and dormant trees.</td>', 'I like how the trail fades off in the distance and draws my eye to the light fog in the trees.  I like the b/w but I do wonder what the color one looks like given the snow and dormant trees.', '2013-02-06 18:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973723, 1049440, 136989, '<td valign="top">Nice choice on the square crop.  I like the reflection and how the heaviness on the bottom is balanced by the wisps of the stems climbing up to the sky.  I wish I could get these guys to stand in such picturesque spots for me. :)</td>', 'Nice choice on the square crop.  I like the reflection and how the heaviness on the bottom is balanced by the wisps of the stems climbing up to the sky.  I wish I could get these guys to stand in such picturesque spots for me. :)', '2013-02-06 18:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973726, 1049070, 136989, '<td valign="top">Okay, points for even knowing someone who can do that!  Grace, beauty and flexibility captured in marvelous detail.</td>', 'Okay, points for even knowing someone who can do that!  Grace, beauty and flexibility captured in marvelous detail.', '2013-02-06 18:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973732, 1049705, 136989, '<td valign="top">I can''t really put into words why I like this pic so much.  Maybe it''s the wall detail, the reflections in the car or the wooden ladder/stairs.  I guess it just all comes together to work. Maybe it''s just that I like the car too.</td>', 'I can''t really put into words why I like this pic so much.  Maybe it''s the wall detail, the reflections in the car or the wooden ladder/stairs.  I guess it just all comes together to work. Maybe it''s just that I like the car too.', '2013-02-06 18:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
