(6973928, 1050872, 114285, '<td valign="top">A masterpiece of intrigue-I actually stared at this for a long while, the PP is excellent, the clouds are awesome and the comp is perfect, all that adds up to a 10, well done.<br/> <br/>My only 10 for the challenge, and you deserve one of these, it''s outstanding in more ways than I can say!! <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a></td>', 'A masterpiece of intrigue-I actually stared at this for a long while, the PP is excellent, the clouds are awesome and the comp is perfect, all that adds up to a 10, well done. My only 10 for the challenge, and you deserve one of these, it''s outstanding in more ways than I can say!! ', '2013-02-07 00:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
