(6975080, 1050702, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is a beauty. I thought I commented on this earlier. The bird, sky and reflection of light off the water -- it all combines for an awesome image. Nice job.</td>', 'This is a beauty. I thought I commented on this earlier. The bird, sky and reflection of light off the water -- it all combines for an awesome image. Nice job.', '2013-02-08 00:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975089, 1051597, 108580, '<td valign="top">WD on your HM Paul! My bird beat your bird :)</td>', 'WD on your HM Paul! My bird beat your bird :)', '2013-02-08 00:45:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975095, 1052166, 674, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait but it is a pity you didn''t make sure that her hair wasn''t hanging in her face and eyes. As a parent this used to drive me mad when the school photographers didn''t check this. On the side I find portraits in FS rather boring, Don''t know the person I am sure her family loved it though!</td>', 'A nice portrait but it is a pity you didn''t make sure that her hair wasn''t hanging in her face and eyes. As a parent this used to drive me mad when the school photographers didn''t check this. On the side I find portraits in FS rather boring, Don''t know the person I am sure her family loved it though!', '2013-02-08 00:48:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975098, 1052192, 674, '<td valign="top">I loved the composition of this!</td>', 'I loved the composition of this!', '2013-02-08 00:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975100, 1049351, 98022, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome capture. Photography such as this is quite difficult. Impressive job and congrats on the HM!</td>', 'This is an awesome capture. Photography such as this is quite difficult. Impressive job and congrats on the HM!', '2013-02-08 00:51:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975102, 1051261, 108580, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear eyes and excellent engagement. Umbrella''s in the catchlight seemed out of place.</td>', 'Crystal clear eyes and excellent engagement. Umbrella''s in the catchlight seemed out of place.', '2013-02-08 00:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975104, 1051610, 114285, '<td valign="top">Nice bling, good one Clive!</td>', 'Nice bling, good one Clive!', '2013-02-08 00:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975109, 1049351, 86218, '<td valign="top">When I saw this shot during voting.. I knew who it was...but wasnt going to risk being wrong...lol. Great capture Harvey. Fabulous shot and well done on placing.</td>', 'When I saw this shot during voting.. I knew who it was...but wasnt going to risk being wrong...lol. Great capture Harvey. Fabulous shot and well done on placing.', '2013-02-08 01:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975120, 1049351, 93421, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Congrats on the HM Harvey</td>', 'Great capture! Congrats on the HM Harvey', '2013-02-08 01:18:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975125, 1049757, 113591, '<td valign="top">Sailing into new dimensions. Thanks.</td>', 'Sailing into new dimensions. Thanks.', '2013-02-08 01:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975131, 1050127, 67697, '<td valign="top">So is that one big cloud kind of settling down over the city?  Or is it steam or dust?  I should add that the cloud is my fave part and then I enjoy seeing the lone person on the dock too.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-08 01:37:22.</i></td>', 'So is that one big cloud kind of settling down over the city?  Or is it steam or dust?  I should add that the cloud is my fave part and then I enjoy seeing the lone person on the dock too.', '2013-02-08 01:36:52.000000', '2013-02-08 01:37:22.000000', 0),
(6975141, 1051854, 62318, '<td valign="top">Ithought the detail was superb. The choice for black and white also good. And the squirrel just looking at the  perfect.</td>', 'Ithought the detail was superb. The choice for black and white also good. And the squirrel just looking at the  perfect.', '2013-02-08 01:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975142, 1052161, 80831, '<td valign="top">Very underrated!</td>', 'Very underrated!', '2013-02-08 01:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975143, 1049351, 113591, '<td valign="top">There you are - New year''s resolution done and dusted in one fell swoop! And not even the second month yet. So Super-Sixteen viewing on the couch the rest of the year? Hehe</td>', 'There you are - New year''s resolution done and dusted in one fell swoop! And not even the second month yet. So Super-Sixteen viewing on the couch the rest of the year? Hehe', '2013-02-08 01:42:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975144, 1051854, 62318, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jaysonmc:</b></div><hr/><i> I lthought the detail was superb. The choice for black and white also good. And the squirrel just looking durectly at you; perfect. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by jaysonmc: I lthought the detail was superb. The choice for black and white also good. And the squirrel just looking durectly at you; perfect. ', '2013-02-08 01:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975148, 1049190, 28742, '<td valign="top">I never understood a single word he said, but I helped him drink his wine (He always had some mighty fine wine).<br/> <br/>...you should have included some wine. ;-) Great image, Lydia. Highly unappreciated.</td>', 'I never understood a single word he said, but I helped him drink his wine (He always had some mighty fine wine). ...you should have included some wine. ;-) Great image, Lydia. Highly unappreciated.', '2013-02-08 01:47:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975149, 1050046, 147314, '<td valign="top">When I saw this image, my first reaction was: who nicked my pic? It was my takeout for this challenge. And then I remembered you were with me that day. LOL<br/>But great image, good sharpness and a good score. And don''t mind those 3''s, these people don''t know anything about the dangerous stuff you had to do in order to get this image.</td>', 'When I saw this image, my first reaction was: who nicked my pic? It was my takeout for this challenge. And then I remembered you were with me that day. LOLBut great image, good sharpness and a good score. And don''t mind those 3''s, these people don''t know anything about the dangerous stuff you had to do in order to get this image.', '2013-02-08 01:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975152, 1052012, 28742, '<td valign="top">OMG... Dontcha just wanna hug that sweet little thing? ...after you wash it off, I mean. ;-)</td>', 'OMG... Dontcha just wanna hug that sweet little thing? ...after you wash it off, I mean. ;-)', '2013-02-08 01:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975153, 1051931, 28742, '<td valign="top">Guilty. No doubt. :P</td>', 'Guilty. No doubt. :P', '2013-02-08 01:53:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975154, 1051751, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow! Is that what''s for dessert? ;-) Awesome image. Well done.</td>', 'Wow! Is that what''s for dessert? ;-) Awesome image. Well done.', '2013-02-08 01:54:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975155, 1051580, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Details:</b></div><hr/><i><b>Location</b>: Seattle </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ahem. She''ll be waiting a LONNNNNG time. :P</td>', 'Originally posted by Details:Location: Seattle  Ahem. She''ll be waiting a LONNNNNG time. :P', '2013-02-08 01:55:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975160, 1049351, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great image again Harvey, these birds are so difficult to shoot. Love the focus and the way it stands against that green background. And congrats on your HM, so close to a ribbon in a FS. VWD!</td>', 'Great image again Harvey, these birds are so difficult to shoot. Love the focus and the way it stands against that green background. And congrats on your HM, so close to a ribbon in a FS. VWD!', '2013-02-08 02:01:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975161, 1051349, 147314, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first Blue and a PB. Outstanding image!</td>', 'Congrats on your first Blue and a PB. Outstanding image!', '2013-02-08 02:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975166, 1051854, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love his expression.  Or at least what I perceive is his expression!!</td>', 'I love his expression.  Or at least what I perceive is his expression!!', '2013-02-08 02:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975167, 1049757, 147314, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Yellow, well deserved. And amazing you managed to score 7+ despite those 1''s, 2''s and 3''s. Really says something about the quality of your image.</td>', 'Congrats on your Yellow, well deserved. And amazing you managed to score 7+ despite those 1''s, 2''s and 3''s. Really says something about the quality of your image.', '2013-02-08 02:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975170, 1049070, 147314, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Red, beautiful image and amazing symmetry.</td>', 'Congrats on the Red, beautiful image and amazing symmetry.', '2013-02-08 02:09:48.000000', NULL, 0);
