(6975653, 1052105, 20799, '<td valign="top">First, the gradient is flawless, one of the best I''ve seen. But even more, I love the choice of composition and use of the black space - very brave. Its placement, the composition of the slope broken by the centered tree is awesome. Reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">rooum</a>''s work.</td>', 'First, the gradient is flawless, one of the best I''ve seen. But even more, I love the choice of composition and use of the black space - very brave. Its placement, the composition of the slope broken by the centered tree is awesome. Reminds me of  rooum''s work.', '2013-02-08 14:01:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975658, 1052001, 93565, '<td valign="top">The water spots on the window are peculiarly odd. They almost seem fake, added in PP. Or maybe the source of something mysterious and unknown. A surprisingly unsettling shot, all things considered.</td>', 'The water spots on the window are peculiarly odd. They almost seem fake, added in PP. Or maybe the source of something mysterious and unknown. A surprisingly unsettling shot, all things considered.', '2013-02-08 14:11:09.000000', NULL, 0),
