(6975661, 1051854, 93565, '<td valign="top">It''s like a sweeter more wintry Wendy shot! More humanizing, as well. I just moved to a house with a tame squirrel (according to the previous owner...) so I might have some Wendy shots coming up, as well ;0  ETA: B/W was definitely the right choice here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-08 14:13:19.</i></td>', 'It''s like a sweeter more wintry Wendy shot! More humanizing, as well. I just moved to a house with a tame squirrel (according to the previous owner...) so I might have some Wendy shots coming up, as well ;0  ETA: B/W was definitely the right choice here.', '2013-02-08 14:13:00.000000', '2013-02-08 14:13:19.000000', 0),
(6975666, 1052105, 93565, '<td valign="top">You know, this is a pretty peculiar shot. You have a silhouetted tree, which doesn''t fill the frame, which is centered, and which has an off-kilter horizon (which is separate from being properly vertical). I like the negative black space a lot, I like the muted colors, a lot. I don''t like the title, but it''s probably because I live close enough to the PRB (that''s People''s Republic of Boulder, for you not in the know (I''ll explain if needed)) that I see those damn stickers on practically everything and it drives me bonkers.</td>', 'You know, this is a pretty peculiar shot. You have a silhouetted tree, which doesn''t fill the frame, which is centered, and which has an off-kilter horizon (which is separate from being properly vertical). I like the negative black space a lot, I like the muted colors, a lot. I don''t like the title, but it''s probably because I live close enough to the PRB (that''s People''s Republic of Boulder, for you not in the know (I''ll explain if needed)) that I see those damn stickers on practically everything and it drives me bonkers.', '2013-02-08 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975677, 1052088, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry this ended so far down in the queue, I think it''s very nice, truly.</td>', 'I''m sorry this ended so far down in the queue, I think it''s very nice, truly.', '2013-02-08 14:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
