(6975749, 1049627, 98339, '<td valign="top">Gerry, I gave you your 10...I know that this is NOT an easy photo to get.  I love the power in it...Personally I think it''s really good...I know that DPC will say not enough detail/to soft in the feathers...but I was wavering between 9/10...10 won it</td>', 'Gerry, I gave you your 10...I know that this is NOT an easy photo to get.  I love the power in it...Personally I think it''s really good...I know that DPC will say not enough detail/to soft in the feathers...but I was wavering between 9/10...10 won it', '2013-02-08 17:48:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975761, 1049627, 124982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> Gerry, I gave you your 10...I know that this is NOT an easy photo to get.  I love the power in it...Personally I think it''s really good...I know that DPC will say not enough detail/to soft in the feathers...but I was wavering between 9/10...10 won it </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Janine, what a lovely treat! I really like it, and you''re right, probably not enough detail. Also, I tried to blur the background out with LR, but didn''t go as well as I''d have liked. Wish I had Photoshop!<br/> <br/>Anyway, thank you again for your comment! And vote!</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: Gerry, I gave you your 10...I know that this is NOT an easy photo to get.  I love the power in it...Personally I think it''s really good...I know that DPC will say not enough detail/to soft in the feathers...but I was wavering between 9/10...10 won it   Thanks Janine, what a lovely treat! I really like it, and you''re right, probably not enough detail. Also, I tried to blur the background out with LR, but didn''t go as well as I''d have liked. Wish I had Photoshop! Anyway, thank you again for your comment! And vote!', '2013-02-08 18:01:07.000000', NULL, 0),
