(6976350, 1049351, 75713, '<td valign="top">Well well Harvey, you outdid yourself on this one - I love to read the settings when Photographers are kind enough to put them in and I am amazed at how crisp the sigma is - mind you I have never held one so I don''t know it''s size but you nailed the important parts - the supper - I love how the wings are positioned - Victorious!  Such a tiny bird and so much to look at well done indeed!</td>', 'Well well Harvey, you outdid yourself on this one - I love to read the settings when Photographers are kind enough to put them in and I am amazed at how crisp the sigma is - mind you I have never held one so I don''t know it''s size but you nailed the important parts - the supper - I love how the wings are positioned - Victorious!  Such a tiny bird and so much to look at well done indeed!', '2013-02-10 06:57:25.000000', NULL, 0),
