(6976538, 1051756, 60495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LoVi:</b></div><hr/><i> I''ve never eaten at Denny''s.....is that a pretty little Farm to Table restaurant like Fraiche?   "Thingy"? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL, sorry, kind of an American reference. I''m not sure what Fraiche is but Denny''s is kind of an old family diner style chain restaurant, typically they have pretty good pies and desserts with traditional american style foods, not real fancy but consistent meals and service through out the chain. Not the type of restaurant you will crave going to but kind of an old stand by with decent food and a variety of choices. Also I believe most of them are open 24 hours so they fill a need for that late night craving for pie!</td>', 'Originally posted by LoVi: I''ve never eaten at Denny''s.....is that a pretty little Farm to Table restaurant like Fraiche?   "Thingy"?   LOL, sorry, kind of an American reference. I''m not sure what Fraiche is but Denny''s is kind of an old family diner style chain restaurant, typically they have pretty good pies and desserts with traditional american style foods, not real fancy but consistent meals and service through out the chain. Not the type of restaurant you will crave going to but kind of an old stand by with decent food and a variety of choices. Also I believe most of them are open 24 hours so they fill a need for that late night craving for pie!', '2013-02-10 13:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6976602, 1051349, 138630, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing - the exposure is perfect and what a moment!  Congratulations on the blue.</td>', 'Mesmerizing - the exposure is perfect and what a moment!  Congratulations on the blue.', '2013-02-10 16:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
