(6978041, 1051597, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What an expression!  The BW is ... perfection!<br/> <br/>I''m not sure what the nakedness plays into the story of the shot since the tension of the expression and the limbs add all I need to get me "into the scene".<br/> <br/>Who waits at the rainy window nekkid?  LOL!<br/> <br/>I suppose it''s the oddness of it all that sells this.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your top ten!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  What an expression!  The BW is ... perfection! I''m not sure what the nakedness plays into the story of the shot since the tension of the expression and the limbs add all I need to get me "into the scene". Who waits at the rainy window nekkid?  LOL! I suppose it''s the oddness of it all that sells this. Congrats on your top ten! ', '2013-02-12 22:42:06.000000', NULL, 0),
