(6978287, 1051597, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow!  What an expression!  The BW is ... perfection!<br/> <br/>I''m not sure what the nakedness plays into the story of the shot since the tension of the expression and the limbs add all I need to get me "into the scene".<br/> <br/>Who waits at the rainy window nekkid?  LOL!<br/> <br/>I suppose it''s the oddness of it all that sells this.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your top ten! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>OK! So it''s a story that makes sense that you want. I can''t promise to deliver on that - I plan to continue on the odd path for a while.<br/> <br/>In the meantime though, here is my non-nude alternate but I don''t believe it has the same power:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1053580" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1053580.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1053580.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1053580.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Wow!  What an expression!  The BW is ... perfection! I''m not sure what the nakedness plays into the story of the shot since the tension of the expression and the limbs add all I need to get me "into the scene". Who waits at the rainy window nekkid?  LOL! I suppose it''s the oddness of it all that sells this. Congrats on your top ten!   OK! So it''s a story that makes sense that you want. I can''t promise to deliver on that - I plan to continue on the odd path for a while. In the meantime though, here is my non-nude alternate but I don''t believe it has the same power: ', '2013-02-13 04:59:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979029, 1048182, 135629, '<td valign="top">They are so great at owning the permanent "F-off" look! Nice shot.</td>', 'They are so great at owning the permanent "F-off" look! Nice shot.', '2013-02-13 22:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979274, 1052022, 60614, '<td valign="top">Looks like one pissed off kitten.  Never seen a cat with wavy short hair.  That is pretty cool.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Looks like one pissed off kitten.  Never seen a cat with wavy short hair.  That is pretty cool.  Nice capture.', '2013-02-14 12:23:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979275, 1051471, 96751, '<td valign="top">Congrats on all the bling, Mark! Go to the light!!!!</td>', 'Congrats on all the bling, Mark! Go to the light!!!!', '2013-02-14 12:25:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979409, 1052022, 143116, '<td valign="top">Amazing kitten. I love cats, we have two at home, and they''re great pals that love to be cuddled. But that''s not what this kitten seems to aspire, at least not at this very moment. I guess I''m not a Devon Rex kind of guy.</td>', 'Amazing kitten. I love cats, we have two at home, and they''re great pals that love to be cuddled. But that''s not what this kitten seems to aspire, at least not at this very moment. I guess I''m not a Devon Rex kind of guy.', '2013-02-14 16:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979559, 1052022, 12253, '<td valign="top">That''s scary!  Fantastic.</td>', 'That''s scary!  Fantastic.', '2013-02-15 00:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979574, 1052022, 75713, '<td valign="top">You did an excellent job in all aspects of this photo but to me, this gotta be the ugliest cat I ever saw- I know it''s the breed  but it looks like it needs a good feed of bacon lol.  However as I said, as awesome job of photographing it.</td>', 'You did an excellent job in all aspects of this photo but to me, this gotta be the ugliest cat I ever saw- I know it''s the breed  but it looks like it needs a good feed of bacon lol.  However as I said, as awesome job of photographing it.', '2013-02-15 00:55:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979579, 1052166, 674, '<td valign="top">@sulamk the interesting thing is that the hair falling between her eyes is why myself and the child''s parent loved this photo. If I ever take up school photography I will keep that hair thing in mind. ;)<br/>That is why photography is so interesting, what one person likes is probably disliked by others! :)</td>', '@sulamk the interesting thing is that the hair falling between her eyes is why myself and the child''s parent loved this photo. If I ever take up school photography I will keep that hair thing in mind. ;)That is why photography is so interesting, what one person likes is probably disliked by others! :)', '2013-02-15 01:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979644, 1051655, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with this image Mike. Great shot and no weird flares</td>', 'Nothing wrong with this image Mike. Great shot and no weird flares', '2013-02-15 05:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6979715, 1052022, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great subject caught at the right moment.  Those teeth look sharp.<br/>Funny, I had never heard of a Devon Rex before this photo (and just last week I was reading about Savannah cats for the first time).  Thanks.</td>', 'Great subject caught at the right moment.  Those teeth look sharp.Funny, I had never heard of a Devon Rex before this photo (and just last week I was reading about Savannah cats for the first time).  Thanks.', '2013-02-15 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6980114, 1052088, 117474, '<td valign="top">A little late... but better late than never, right? <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1000203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif"/></a></td>', 'A little late... but better late than never, right? ', '2013-02-16 07:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6980169, 1052022, 63218, '<td valign="top">Look at those needle-sharp teeth!</td>', 'Look at those needle-sharp teeth!', '2013-02-16 09:06:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6980246, 1050077, 31239, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments and votes.<br/> <br/>Was secretly hoping to get into the top 25 with this, but top 80 it has to be.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments and votes. Was secretly hoping to get into the top 25 with this, but top 80 it has to be.', '2013-02-16 13:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6980250, 1052022, 141319, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but were it not for the straight cage bars, I would have sworn you elongated the neck and widened the mouth in pp :-). What a funny shot of a seriously annoyed kitten.</td>', 'I hate to say it, but were it not for the straight cage bars, I would have sworn you elongated the neck and widened the mouth in pp :-). What a funny shot of a seriously annoyed kitten.', '2013-02-16 13:52:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6982003, 1049351, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great in-flight catch!  I love the out of focus, barely discernible, grasses behind the bird!</td>', 'Great in-flight catch!  I love the out of focus, barely discernible, grasses behind the bird!', '2013-02-19 23:09:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6982588, 1052022, 5112, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look all that happy to be in that cage :)  That long neck is really something else.  As kasaba said, my first thought was that you somehow elongated the neck and worked on the mouth.  She has really curly fur!</td>', 'She doesn''t look all that happy to be in that cage :)  That long neck is really something else.  As kasaba said, my first thought was that you somehow elongated the neck and worked on the mouth.  She has really curly fur!', '2013-02-20 17:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6982691, 1052114, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think the colors are very complimentary here. Good focus and good pose. Cheers!<br/> <br/>You still doing the fire shots?</td>', 'I think the colors are very complimentary here. Good focus and good pose. Cheers! You still doing the fire shots?', '2013-02-20 21:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6982692, 1052155, 62318, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely path to walk down. Walked down several myself.<br/>Nothing more peaceful than a winter stroll.<br/> <br/>Great tones here too!</td>', 'Such a lovely path to walk down. Walked down several myself.Nothing more peaceful than a winter stroll. Great tones here too!', '2013-02-20 21:16:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6982693, 1051105, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed how you positioned all the elements in the photography. Well done.</td>', 'I really enjoyed how you positioned all the elements in the photography. Well done.', '2013-02-20 21:16:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6982696, 1052192, 62318, '<td valign="top">This composition is spot on. The scene very enjoyable. And the colors perfect.<br/>That back window and the shapes make the shot.</td>', 'This composition is spot on. The scene very enjoyable. And the colors perfect.That back window and the shapes make the shot.', '2013-02-20 21:17:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6983046, 1051375, 62318, '<td valign="top">Something about forest mushrooms makes them magical. I like the deep rich tones here. Good composition and detail. Good stuff. <br/>Might try a gander at B&amp;W for this photo, I bet it would really bring out the detail.</td>', 'Something about forest mushrooms makes them magical. I like the deep rich tones here. Good composition and detail. Good stuff. Might try a gander at B&W for this photo, I bet it would really bring out the detail.', '2013-02-21 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6984004, 1052026, 68504, '<td valign="top">You have outlayered yourself. Crowd wanted tinsel on the tree.</td>', 'You have outlayered yourself. Crowd wanted tinsel on the tree.', '2013-02-22 15:53:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6984719, 1052175, 109387, '<td valign="top">Very nice one Neil!</td>', 'Very nice one Neil!', '2013-02-23 17:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6984926, 1051479, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect in B&amp;W - lots of layers, lots of textures, and a snowdog!</td>', 'Perfect in B&W - lots of layers, lots of textures, and a snowdog!', '2013-02-24 00:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6984976, 1051635, 30982, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a Japanese print, but in gentle shades of gray.  I especially like the wee bits of vegetation along the second to last ridge.</td>', 'This reminds me of a Japanese print, but in gentle shades of gray.  I especially like the wee bits of vegetation along the second to last ridge.', '2013-02-24 00:51:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6985114, 1051120, 69325, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the better late than never Critique Club!<br/> <br/>First impressions: Excellent, almost Ansel-like. The dominant object in the shot of course is the ray of sun light. You did an excellent job capturing that. Everything in the shot, from the mountains to the clouds, stands in tack-sharp clarity. The seperation of the mountain tops from sky is especially pleasing to the eye. The ray of light, of course, acts to draw the eye nicely from the sky to the hills.<br/>The voters rewarded your hard work, excellent placing in a free study.<br/>If I were to think of things I would change in the shot, it seems as though the tones of the black and white conversion could have some more contrast. I am left wishing (at least on my monitor) that I could see more details in the lower part of the hills.<br/>However, I don''t think these things alone take away from an excellent shot. I would have no problem hanging this on my wall.<br/> <br/>Congrats on an excellent shot.<br/> <br/>J</td>', 'Greetings from the better late than never Critique Club! First impressions: Excellent, almost Ansel-like. The dominant object in the shot of course is the ray of sun light. You did an excellent job capturing that. Everything in the shot, from the mountains to the clouds, stands in tack-sharp clarity. The seperation of the mountain tops from sky is especially pleasing to the eye. The ray of light, of course, acts to draw the eye nicely from the sky to the hills.The voters rewarded your hard work, excellent placing in a free study.If I were to think of things I would change in the shot, it seems as though the tones of the black and white conversion could have some more contrast. I am left wishing (at least on my monitor) that I could see more details in the lower part of the hills.However, I don''t think these things alone take away from an excellent shot. I would have no problem hanging this on my wall. Congrats on an excellent shot. J', '2013-02-24 09:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6985152, 1052192, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, and I particularly like that she''s shooting out of the frame.  What a great location!</td>', 'Excellent composition, and I particularly like that she''s shooting out of the frame.  What a great location!', '2013-02-24 11:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6985172, 1051944, 123348, '<td valign="top">I love this image and I am surprised it did not make it to the tt or at least top twenty. It''s a favorite to me!</td>', 'I love this image and I am surprised it did not make it to the tt or at least top twenty. It''s a favorite to me!', '2013-02-24 11:59:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6985214, 1051597, 30982, '<td valign="top">This really is very striking, and yes, creates a sense of unease but also of power.  In my opinion, the nudity adds to this - though some may say it adds a sense of vulnerability, it strikes me more as confidence.</td>', 'This really is very striking, and yes, creates a sense of unease but also of power.  In my opinion, the nudity adds to this - though some may say it adds a sense of vulnerability, it strikes me more as confidence.', '2013-02-24 13:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6985338, 1051895, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent - really like this one!!</td>', 'Excellent - really like this one!!', '2013-02-24 17:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6986130, 1052022, 66952, '<td valign="top">Get me OUT of here!!!! Really well done, given the circumstances you had to work with. Cat shows are lousy places to get a good shot. The expression and attitude work great with the....ummmm....unusual...appearance of the cat.</td>', 'Get me OUT of here!!!! Really well done, given the circumstances you had to work with. Cat shows are lousy places to get a good shot. The expression and attitude work great with the....ummmm....unusual...appearance of the cat.', '2013-02-25 19:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6992285, 1052114, 62787, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jaysonmc:</b></div><hr/><i> I think the colors are very complimentary here. Good focus and good pose. Cheers!<br/> <br/>You still doing the fire shots? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks :) <br/> <br/>And yes - I am indeed, though not particularly often anymore. Various bits of work and life seem to get in the way of photography a lot, though hoping to do more of it regularly once things settle down again.</td>', 'Originally posted by jaysonmc: I think the colors are very complimentary here. Good focus and good pose. Cheers! You still doing the fire shots?   Thanks :)  And yes - I am indeed, though not particularly often anymore. Various bits of work and life seem to get in the way of photography a lot, though hoping to do more of it regularly once things settle down again.', '2013-03-05 16:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7013350, 1052022, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the kitten, especially under cat show conditions. I know that the sign gives the shot context, but I really like it when I scroll down and eliminate the top of the cage.</td>', 'Great capture of the kitten, especially under cat show conditions. I know that the sign gives the shot context, but I really like it when I scroll down and eliminate the top of the cage.', '2013-04-04 07:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7033552, 1051805, 103142, '<td valign="top">He''s gorgeous!</td>', 'He''s gorgeous!', '2013-05-07 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 0);
